# Dependencies and build output.
node_modules/
dist/

# macOS.
.DS_Store

# GATE AND PROBE OUTPUT — every one of these directories is REGENERABLE.
#
# `npm run gates` rewrites look-out, perf-out, city-out and wind-out; the
# not-a-gate probes rewrite the rest. Together they are ~410 MB of PNGs, logs,
# traces and one mp4 against 3.7 MB of source, and none of it is an input to
# anything: the gates read `budget.json`, `city-budget.json` and
# `look-budget.json`, which are tracked.
#
# What this costs, said out loud rather than discovered by a reader following a
# link: STATE.md cites frames in tools/walk-out/ and tools/look-out/ by name,
# and those paths will not resolve in a fresh clone until the gates and
# `node tools/walkprobe.mjs` have been run. The numbers beside each citation are
# in STATE.md itself, which is the part that has to survive.
#
# `docs/` is NOT ignored: README.md embeds docs/gait-coated-cycle.png and the
# design notes there are authored rather than generated.
tools/look-out/
tools/perf-out/
tools/city-out/
tools/wind-out/
tools/shot-out/
tools/gait-out/
tools/film-out/
tools/loft-out/
tools/hull-out/
tools/motion-out/
tools/profile-out/
tools/walk-out/
